  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一款 Serilum 模组。用心打造。为 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"关于此模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>Flower Mimics 是一款为 SpookyJam 2023 制作的模组。它高度可配置。默认情况下，每当玩家在夜间走动时，任意花朵都有可能成为伪装者（Mimic）并转化为生物。触发时会有闪电劈下。该伪装者会拥有自定义名称。当玩家击杀这些伪装者时，会掉落额外物品和经验值。转化前的原始花朵会被放回原位。花朵成为伪装者的概率为 <strong>1/50</strong>。<br><br><strong>可能会造成突发惊吓！👻</strong></span><span><br><br>虽然预设了即时经验值的数值，但您可以修改大量行为逻辑。例如哪些花朵可以变成伪装者、击杀后掉落什么物品，以及伪装者出现的时间和方式等详细设置。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收录于 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"收录于 Serilum 的 RPG 捆绑包\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"环境：服务端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可配置项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用配置选项：</p>\n<details><summary>显示剧透</summary>\n<p><span><strong>flowerIsMimicChance</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 0.02，最小 0，最大 1.0<br>遇到花朵变为伪装者并转化为生物的概率。<br><br><span><strong>extraExperienceOnMimicDeath</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 30<br>每当击杀一个伪装者时应掉落的额外经验值数量。<br><br><span><strong>dropExtraItemsOnMimicDeath</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true<br>是否在每次击杀伪装者时，按照 ./config/flowermimics/.. 中指定的内容掉落额外物品。<br><br><span><strong>onlyTransformMimicsAtNight</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true<br>是否只在夜间将花朵转化为生物。禁用后，花朵可随时转化。<br><br><span><strong>resetMimicsBeforeNightTime</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true<br>当白天转为夜晚时，是否重置花朵可能转化为伪装者的状态。<br><br><span><strong>removeFlowerBlockOnMimicSpawn</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true<br>是否在伪装者生成时移除其来源的花朵方块。<br><br><span><strong>dropFlowerItemOnMimicDeath</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 false<br>是否在伪装者死亡时掉落其对应的花朵物品。需启用 'removeFlowerBlockOnMimicSpawn'。<br><br><span><strong>replaceOriginalFlowerBlockOnMimicDeath</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true<br>是否在伪装者死亡时将原始花朵方块放回原处。需启用 'removeFlowerBlockOnMimicSpawn'。目标位置必须有空气方块。<br><br><span><strong>placeFlowerBlockWhereMimicDies</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 false<br>是否在伪装者死亡的地点放置一个花朵方块。需启用 'removeFlowerBlockOnMimicSpawn'。目标位置必须有空气方块。<br><br><span><strong>showLightningOnMimicSpawn</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true<br>是否在伪装者生成时显示闪电效果。<br><br><span><strong>showLightningOnFlowerBlockReturn</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true<br>是否在花朵方块被重新放置到世界中时显示闪电效果。<br><br><span><strong>preventMimicsOnPlacedAndBoneMealFlowers</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true<br>是否阻止玩家手动放置或使用骨粉催熟的花朵生成伪装者。<br><br><span><strong>checkForMimicAroundBlockRange</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 15，最小 1，最大 30<br>模组应在距离玩家多远范围内检测伪装者。增加此值会消耗更多计算资源。<br><br><span><strong>mimicTransformAroundPlayerRange</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 5，最小 1，最大 30<br>玩家需靠近花朵伪装者多远才会触发其转化。<br><br><span><strong>checkForMimicFlowersDelayInTicks</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 50，最小 1，最大 3600000<br>模组应多久检查一次玩家周围的伪装者花朵。20 刻 = 1 秒<br><br></p>\n<p><span>此外，还有两个配置文件位于 <em><strong>./config/flowermimics/ 目录下：</strong></em></span><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>您可以配置花朵伪装者转化为何种实体。同样支持模组添加的实体与花朵：</strong><br><em>./config/flowermimics/flower_mimics.txt</em></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/flower-mimics/a.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>您可以更改花朵伪装者击杀后掉落的物品：</strong><br><em>./config/flowermimics/flower_item_drops.txt</em></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/flower-mimics/b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>夜间走动时请小心！一朵花可能只是另有玄机：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示剧透</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/flower-mimics/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><span><strong>默认情况下，每当您击杀伪装者时，它会将原始花朵放回原位。伪装者还会掉落额外物品和经验值：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示剧透</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/flower-mimics/d.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"注意事项与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>只要下载源保持在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态内，您可自由在任何整合包中使用本模组。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><span><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他反馈，请访问&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 仓库</a>。感谢支持！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
